OL,5,G1100 Wild River
OL,6,     F(1960) Montgomery Clift and Lee
OL,7,     FRemick star in Elia Kazan's
OL,8,     Fmelancholy romance. A bureaucrat
OL,9,     Fmeets resistance and finds wild
OL,10,     Flove when he's sent to evict
OL,11,     Fresidents to make way for a dam.
OL,12,G1315 Fixed Bayonets!
OL,13,     F(1951) Korean War drama about the
OL,14,     Fstress of battle. Officers drop
OL,15,     Fone by one as a US platoon fights
OL,16,     Fa rearguard action, leaving one
OL,17,     Funwilling man (Richard Basehart)
OL,18,     Fto take their place.
